{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "053d1c4e8ff5bff14d367346fc4c8d7a13012a7eb6a118b07b7345a26ee9da24", "ja": "青羽さん。どうしたんですか？\nなんだか楽しそうですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，有什么好事吗？\n你看起来好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "4a86e3a1f990164bcbdbc4d9166ab01d8928feb165b2cb865398d471b22c4f8b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nそんなに楽しそうにしてましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n我看起来有那么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6c42dd020a371d5681b35d2871aa9977bb80e3fe4fd84e56a2f426b3af90b833", "ja": "はい。\nなんだか、ふわふわ～っとした足取りでしたよ。", "zh": "有啊。\n感觉你走起路来轻飘飘的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "2c3d6662b425f8b6747c7648902239b3df2d71db28c3642bd1b83758c79ed281", "ja": "えへへ、恥ずかしいな……。\nちょっと、お買い物のことを考えてたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，真不好意思……\n其实我是在想要买的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a72174f93f7e5ed03d8b50a9055ce217960815ac0b5db421d55b8309f1c62d63", "ja": "そういえば、ボーナスが出ましたからね。\n青羽さん、何か買うんですか？", "zh": "这么一说，奖金已经发下来了呢。\n青羽小姐，你打算买什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "4909fd3e2330947032533991a2d200977ac7cd39cf7331571b389650b40e7387", "ja": "私は、ワンピースを……ああっ！　そうだ、\n{$P$}さんに伝言がありました！", "zh": "我想要买洋装……啊啊！对了，\n我有事情要转告{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "23a7a6967518df21755849fd7a525d76206a76834e6b86f5a79081a2f98b1aee", "ja": "社長さんが、呼んでましたよ。\n事務所に行ってみてもらえますか？", "zh": "社长正在找你喔。\n可以请你去事务所一趟吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "903a128af8d325010727def66a60350393127d686bc89b400dc3eaabde536864", "ja": "わかりました。\n今度はどんな話かな……。", "zh": "我知道了。\n这次是什么事情呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f73552d9aea77568a6a1c799dc1e50bd0be607d160544b643435aeba0ae8c1ba", "ja": "社長。\nお話というのはなんですか？", "zh": "社长，\n请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "afe2b1268a26b94a455f0bfc82fff66ce9dbc2aa0afd52c399de32d504f81c05", "ja": "おおっ、よく来てくれたね、君！\n待っていたよ。", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦！\n我在等你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "96bcdd95a8aaca75e095c36c2ec421a3b054af4f21d93b91cb8531abed9cd0e6", "ja": "実は、先日君に依頼した\n出版社のオーディションの件なんだが……。", "zh": "是这样的，\n之前拜托你处理的出版社甄选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d2a3396802c4836b98242d3471ae97b9ea9295ffe6ce94c7c23c22c5f8ea6f5d", "ja": "少女漫画雑誌の、イメージモデルの件ですね。\nどうでしたか？", "zh": "是甄选少女漫画杂志的形象模特儿，对吧？\n请问怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2ac2a90242f42cdb0496fcd78c2bcb482e86c2da62178f1a1d3214b266cff3e5", "ja": "翼、茜、可憐と、タイプの違う3人を\n選んでみたんですが……。", "zh": "我当时挑选了翼、茜、可怜，\n这三位不同类型的人选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "c9c93e0845e2330a9e60d862a7ebe42d926e18bbc8751258b5bf86526585fc29", "ja": "うむ。先方から連絡があって、\nぜひ彼女達にお願いしたい、ということだよ！", "zh": "嗯，客户联络我说，\n非常希望能请她们担任模特儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5f7ad79776e325716d3c2469a7168cebf7f69eca2674dac59a86ecf703bdb854", "ja": "えっ、3人とも採用ですか！？", "zh": "什么？三个人通通录取了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f0557782a9c2ae7db293b33c3b075762cc74722af658460cdc86ee1861a31d07", "ja": "ああ。\n君に任せた私の目に、狂いはなかったようだね。", "zh": "没错。\n看来我没看走眼，交给你是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7cf32a180977d12f9ae75b65567a9114826534a95a989798281164c139cfab4b", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n急いで、3人に伝えますね！", "zh": "谢谢社长！\n我马上就去告诉她们三个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "cd8ee1eebbb33d63381ba6af46673d20f9aa3dd5bac2f39753b7823fa12d8674", "ja": "うむ！　それで、先方からその雑誌の\nサンプルが、早速送られてきたんだが……。", "zh": "嗯！还有，客户也已经送来杂志的样本了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "b80a91fdbbf1da903dd90f70402c8a2d8910ebae1184ad400233f640ccfa6b64", "ja": "君はこの雑誌を、知っているかね？　なんでも、\n少女漫画雑誌では発行部数ナンバーワンらしいね。", "zh": "你知道这本杂志吗？\n听说在少女漫画杂志中发行量居冠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2bc1d3d11ec930e4746cbb2d5ba0f1514cd1078a2b8e7968f2073c32b5f4ba43", "ja": "いえ……CMは見た事があると思うんですが、\n実際に読んだことはなくて。", "zh": "没有……广告我应该有看过，\n但没有实际读过杂志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "cecc9142d70c93093a5baa1db3c4141b0c103d797e44561b8d798cb4035ba8fe", "ja": "あっ！　社長、それ『りるきゃん』じゃないですか？\n懐かしいなぁ～。", "zh": "啊！社长，请问那是《莉露甜心》吗？\n好怀念喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "459cfb6313835e6991662e2e2a70a38dffcd96b8f4fa0717dcf3f0550d674207", "ja": "音無さんはこの雑誌、知ってるんですね。", "zh": "看来音无小姐知道这本杂志呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "46d69005f139fcb75ee10e355e5cea4eac9c6be108fe9dc39f8ae22ccb5b4c63", "ja": "もちろんですよ！　有名な少女漫画雑誌で、\n私も子どもの頃は読んでましたから。", "zh": "那当然啰！这是很知名的少女漫画杂志，\n我小时候也很常看喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "1b179b02eb05b7f6bf956cb7dfcf74e65ab4a08f44d4dfbc545385d50ac16ea1", "ja": "そっか、可憐ちゃん達が『りるきゃん』に……\nなんだか感慨深いですね……。", "zh": "这样啊，可怜她们要登上《莉露甜心》……\n感触好深喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f9a00c70f9394e0e7957a8506b9f6a159e682f98adea283222e18ccdb4e541c1", "ja": "そんなに有名なんですね。これはみんなにも、\n気合いを入れてもらわなくちゃだな……。", "zh": "原来是这么知名的杂志，\n看来得请她们三个好好努力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "6521651ba38dd5cd5de062831413bb5384be4790177db26fdaa97541c48bcc90", "ja": "うふふ、楽しみにしてますね！\n少女漫画って、いいですよね……。", "zh": "呵呵，真令人期待！\n少女漫画真的很棒呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "cf3d63aeb346e6e795352d54ff4582467691b8defefcd4b859e55ed124431c7a", "ja": "愛してはいけない人を愛してしまった、悲劇……。\n運命にもてあそばれながらも、熱く燃え盛る愛……！", "zh": "爱上不该爱的人，这是何等悲剧……\n就算遭到命运捉弄，爱火依旧熊熊燃烧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "53ad6bbc8e424638a1dbd808e51729a81a8500d719bcf9b4c4ca8952726a81ac", "ja": "音無さんのイメージは、ちょっと古いような……。", "zh": "音无小姐的印象好像有点年代了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "519f6edc37f6b57699152f4c6c3b7269a591166cda2a59cd3005db28c8483c53", "ja": "ガーン！", "zh": "大受打击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "94eb1df6a7f3160d21ce6711b9c75bc06eb2b6e9410c55b7fa7740eb1d43f92a", "ja": "今はもう少しライトな感じで、普通の女の子の恋愛や\nファッションを扱った作品がウケてるみたいですね。", "zh": "现在的少女漫画杂志比较轻松一点，\n描写普通女生的恋爱还有流行打扮的作品似乎较受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "0af90175f45c8ce93cfbbd30e60fcee19cf557292cbf935e5d1d868a2068a1c4", "ja": "そうなのか。\n私も『りるきゃん』を読んで、少女漫画を勉強するよ。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我也来看看《莉露甜心》，了解一下少女漫画吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "ccac9703d7972c44dd87ca921e1ffcd04ba3760803c5fc9ebabdc677ae016e7f", "ja": "何冊かもらったから、君も持っていきたまえ。\n研究のためにね。", "zh": "客户送来了好几本，你也拿几本过去吧，\n这样才能做研究。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "761de2ed71dcab7a8f370f923b90d2dd04b24f5d2274ac65d8a08a94b1c61158", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n帰って、じっくり読んでみます！", "zh": "谢谢社长……\n我回去会认真研读的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "e148b666f07e755cb04820fdb04904e2a97e8b9db49273d7d42dc9306425e926", "ja": "それじゃあ、君。\n今回の仕事も、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "很好，那么，\n这次的工作就交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
